{"seq":1,"slug":"management-and-character","title":"管理与为人争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/management-and-character","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-harsh-management-style","title":"严苛的管理风格","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/management-and-character/the-harsh-management-style","wordCount":1868,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"credit-and-collaboration","title":"功劳与协作","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/management-and-character/credit-and-collaboration","wordCount":1944,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 管理与为人争议\n\n乔布斯的争议，首先集中在他的管理风格与为人处世上。本章直面这两个备受讨论的话题。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"严苛的管理风格\"——他对卓越的极致追求，如何以冷酷的方式表现，既激发成就也造成伤害。第二篇文档讲述\"功劳与协作\"，审视他的个人光环如何掩盖团队贡献，及\"谁才是真正创造者\"的争论。\n"}